I noticed your question on the forums got a response so you might send that
zip file to them also.  I did a little debugging.  I can say it's happening
in the Rsquared extraction part of the extractModelParameters, presumably
because the r2Section created has both a within level and a between level
output (though between is blank). The error occurs when
extractParameters_1section is called.  You can pass that info along to them
in case it helps them pinpoint the issue.

extractModelParameters ->
     extractParameters_1file -> error

Within extractParemeters1file function:
extractParemeters1file -> extractParameters_1section (line 51 for me)
     r2Section -> error

